cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: VISOR-serve: a descriptor-driven server for environment-isolated tools
abstract: An HTTP server that executes tools it never imports, each in its own interpreter, from one JSON descriptor per tool.
type: software
license: MIT
